    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεγκ-τέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέγχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				refute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				905d
			</span></i>; <i>one must reject, disapprove</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				23.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>one must test</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>one must convict</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21.253a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεγκτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>to be
			refuted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.35
			</span></i>.</div>
